  --job-type: string@job-type-completer # Indicates SageMaker job type compatibility. TRAINING: The image version is compatible with SageMaker training jobs. INFERENCE: The image version is compatible with SageMaker inference jobs. NOTEBOOK_KERNEL: The image version is compatible with SageMaker notebook kernels.
