  --tags: list # An array of key/value pairs. For more information, see Using Cost Allocation Tags (https://docs.aws.amazon.com/awsaccountbilling/latest/aboutv2/cost-alloc-tags.html#allocation-what) in the Amazon Web Services Billing and Cost Management User Guide. — item shape: {Key: string, Value: string}
