  --kms-key-id: string # The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of a Amazon Web Services Key Management Service key that SageMaker uses to encrypt data on the storage volume attached to your notebook instance. The KMS key you provide must be enabled. For information, see Enabling and Disabling Keys (https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/developerguide/enabling-keys.html) in the Amazon Web Services Key Management Service Developer Guide.
