  --lifecycle-config-name: string # The name of a lifecycle configuration to associate with the notebook instance. For information about lifestyle configurations, see Step 2.1: (Optional) Customize a Notebook Instance (https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sagemaker/latest/dg/notebook-lifecycle-config.html).
